ck-wifikiller (2.5.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security audit: decloak deauth used AP BSSID instead of client station MAC.
  * Process.devnull FD leak fixed (subprocess.DEVNULL); interrupt escalates to SIGKILL.
  * Temp path traversal blocked; delete_temp uses rmtree.
  * Validate interface/BSSID/channel; cracked.json atomic write + corrupt-file guard.
  * Vendor advisory now uses ESSID; hashcat options ordered before positionals.
  * WPS state comparisons use WPSState; aireplay stdout handle closed on stop.

